  m_Name: NoteData_Ship
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  statueName: Ship
  pages:
  - 'This is an ancient Egyptian boat!

    Egyptians used ships on the great

    River
    Nile, the longest river

    in the whole world!


    They sailed to trade food,
    gold,

    and beautiful things with faraway lands.'
  - "The sails were made from papyrus,\nthe same plant they used to make paper!\n\nImagine
    sailing down the Nile,\npast crocodiles and tall palm trees.\nWhere would YOU
    go?  \u26F5"
